<title>SOUTH AFRICA: S.Africa Q4 current acct deficit 50 million rand.</title>
<headline>S.Africa Q4 current acct deficit 50 million rand.</headline>
<dateline>PRETORIA 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa recorded a deficit of 50 million rand on the current account of the balance of payments in the three months to December 31 1996, the Reserve Bank said.  </p>
<p>Data in billions of rand:</p>
<p>						 Q4/96   Q3/96    Q2/96</p>
<p>    Merchandise exports		  28.17   26.55    23.44</p>
<p>    Net gold exports			6.55    7.18     6.33</p>
<p>    Service receipts			6.34    5.58     5.08</p>
<p>    Merchandise imports		  30.68   32.31    28.54</p>
<p>    Payments for services		10.39    9.93     9.86</p>
<p>    Total goods and services	   -0.16   -2.93    -3.55</p>
<p>    Transfers				-0.34   -0.29    -0.29</p>
<p>    Balance on current account	 -0.50   -2.96    -3.58</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
